                "text": "Social Security doesn\u2019t work in a vacuum. Cuts to Medicare & Medicaid threaten the whole foundation of retirement security \u2014 and that\u2019s exactly what Republicans are doing with their \"budget bill.\" Seniors deserve dignity, not just survival.",
