                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Without a bipartisan deal to protect healthcare tax credits, many Arizonans will see their coverage costs increase by hundreds or more per year.\n\nYesterday I joined @RepYassAnsari, @RandyKeating, and @ValledelSolAZ to discuss the risks and the path forward. \n\nMy takeaways: https://t.co/2WgmMB8Uej",
