                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Time is running out to avoid a crisis that could throw millions of Americans off their healthcare.\n\nWorking with the @HouseBudgetDems, we found how damaging it will be for Arizonans if Washington Republicans refuse to negotiate a healthcare deal to avert a shutdown. https://t.co/ClvdqIBGuS",
