                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "4 million Americans are in danger of losing their health insurance, and 20 million face their premiums doubling or worse.\n\nDemocrats have a plan to stop it, but the @HouseGOP won\u2019t even sit down to talk.\n\nMore on my thoughts below \u2b07\ufe0f",
