                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Americans want to see Congress keep their health care affordable.\n\nThe last thing people need right now is skyrocketing insurance prices. I\u2019m committed to working across the aisle to keep costs down for families across the country. https://t.co/JAw0oBW8MG",
