                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The lights are still dark in Congress.\n\nThe House has been closed for four weeks while Americans across the country are getting letters saying their insurance costs are about to skyrocket.\n\nMr. Speaker, call us back to Washington so we can get to work.",
                "text_lang": "en",
