                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "People don't stop getting sick when they lose insurance, but they may start rationing meds or skipping doctors' appointments.\n\nAnd when people delay regular treatment, emergency rooms end up crowded & overwhelmed.\n\nWe have to make sure health care remains accessible to everyone.",
