                "text": "Republicans have been MIA for over 6 weeks. They aren\u2019t just stopping us from saving health care, they\u2019re blocking progress on key bipartisan bills to set\n\n\ud83c\udf3e Farm & agriculture policy\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Highway & rail funding\n\n\ud83c\udf0a Flood insurance coverage\n\n@SpeakerJohnson must bring us back now.",
